{"step_index":265,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T12:58:11Z","input_tokens":6931,"cache_read_tokens":187350,"output_tokens":5080,"thinking":"The goal is to create a DSA learning tool that is both beginner-friendly and comprehensive. The tool should function as a workbench that explores all iterations and steps for any given code, including loop-based and recursive DSA algorithms. The objective is to make DSA concepts easily understandable and practical through an interactive dry-run environment.\n\n\nEnvisioning a dynamic navigation bar above the code visualization that clearly labels each phase or iteration of an algorithm or data structure operation. This navigation will offer a quick way for users to jump between steps in an OOP approach or loop, offering a clear visual aid.\n\n\nA clear visual indicator and navigation for each phase or iteration is essential. This allows users to follow the execution step-by-step, regardless of whether it involves object-oriented operations or loops. The \"All Iterations & Steps\" section should be immediately visible and offer a comprehensive overview.\n\n\nFocus is on establishing a clear, step-by-step visual representation of algorithm execution. A comprehensive table illustrating each step, line of code, and variable change across iterations is envisioned. The goal is to provide a user-friendly interface for DSA learning.\n\n\nA quick-jump navigation bar will be placed within the teaching area. This bar will allow users to instantly move between algorithm iterations or phases. The \"All Iterations & Steps\" button will be added to the top bar for quick access. This enhances the user experience by providing clear access to the algorithm's complete execution flow.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Teach Me This Code — Thonny-Style Visual Execution & DSA Iteration Explorer</title>\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:,\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Clean, Simple Top Navigation Bar -->\n  <header class=\"top-bar\">\n    <div class=\"brand-area\">\n      <span class=\"teacher-badge\">Teach Me This Code</span>\n      <span id=\"stepProgressLabel\" class=\"step-progress-label\">Step 1 of 50</span>\n      <span id=\"activeScopeBadge\" class=\"scope-pill scope-global\">GLOBAL SCOPE</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Simple Navigation Controls + Thonny Sub-Expression Stepper -->\n    <nav class=\"nav-controls\" aria-label=\"Step Navigation\">\n      <button id=\"btnPrev\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Go back one step (Left Arrow)\">← Previous</button>\n      <button id=\"btnSubStep\" class=\"btn-nav btn-substep\" title=\"Step through internal sub-expressions on this line (F7)\">🔍 Sub-Expr (F7)</button>\n      <button id=\"btnNext\" class=\"btn-nav btn-next-prominent\" title=\"Explain the next step (Right Arrow)\">Next Step →</button>\n      <button id=\"btnAutoPlay\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Automatically step through the code\">▶ Auto Play</button>\n      <button id=\"btnRestart\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Start over from Step 1\">↺ Restart</button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <div class=\"secondary-actions\">\n      <button id=\"btnEditCode\" class=\"btn-small-primary\">✏️ Paste / Edit Code</button>\n      <button id=\"btnToggleIterations\" class=\"btn-subtle active\" title=\"Show or hide the full Iteration & All-Steps Dry-Run panel below\">📋 All Steps / Iterations</button>\n      <button id=\"btnToggleAdvanced\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Advanced View</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Error / Validation Banner (Hidden unless there is an error) -->\n  <div id=\"validationBanner\" class=\"validation-banner hidden\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Dynamic Overview Banner -->\n  <div class=\"overview-strip\">\n    <span class=\"overview-label\">Goal:</span>\n    <span id=\"overviewText\">Paste or edit any Python program on the left to visualize every step, iteration, variable scope, and memory address.</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- =========================================================\n       MAIN 3-AREA THONNY-STYLE WORKSPACE\n       1. Your Code (Left)\n       2. Step-by-Step Teaching, Iteration Bar & Sub-Expression Evaluator (Center)\n       3. Scope Isolation & Stack/Heap Reference Visualizer (Right)\n       ========================================================= -->\n  <main class=\"three-area-workspace\">\n\n    <!-- AREA 1: YOUR CODE (LEFT) -->\n    <section class=\"area-card area-code\" aria-label=\"Your Code\">\n      <div class=\"area-header-row\">\n        <h2 class=\"area-heading\">Your Code</h2>\n        <div class=\"code-header-actions\">\n          <span id=\"codeScopeIndicator\" class=\"code-scope-tag\">Scope: Global</span>\n          <button id=\"btnAnalyzeCode\" class=\"btn-small-primary hidden\">▶ Run Code</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"codeLinesContainer\" class=\"code-view\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Code Editor Textarea when user clicks \"Paste / Edit Code\" -->\n      <div id=\"liveEditorWrap\" class=\"live-editor-wrap hidden\">\n        <div class=\"editor-template-bar\">\n          <span class=\"drawer-label\">Quick DSA Templates:</span>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-template\" data-template=\"stack_class\">Stack (OOP)</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-template\" data-template=\"max_subarray\">Kadane's Max Subarray</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-template\" data-template=\"binary_search\">Binary Search</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-template\" data-template=\"recursion_factorial\">Recursion (Factorial)</button>\n        </div>\n        <textarea id=\"codeTextarea\" class=\"code-textarea\" placeholder=\"Paste any Python code here...\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea>\n        <div class=\"editor-input-bar\">\n          <label class=\"drawer-label\" for=\"inputPlaygroundField\">Optional Function Input (leave empty if your code calls itself):</label>\n          <input id=\"inputPlaygroundField\" type=\"text\" class=\"drawer-input\" placeholder=\"e.g. nums = [-2, 1, -3, 4] or arr = [1, 3, 5, 7], target = 5\" spellcheck=\"false\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- AREA 2: TEACHING AREA, ITERATION JUMP BAR & THONNY EXPRESSION STEPPER (CENTER) -->\n    <section class=\"area-card area-teaching\" aria-label=\"Step-by-Step Explanation\">\n      <div class=\"teaching-card-inner\">\n\n        <!-- Quick Iteration / Call Phase Jump Bar -->\n        <div class=\"iteration-jump-strip\">\n          <div class=\"iteration-jump-header\">\n            <span class=\"iteration-jump-label\">🔄 Iterations & Execution Phases (Click to Jump):</span>\n            <span id=\"activeIterationBadge\" class=\"iteration-active-badge\">Phase 1</span>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"iterationPillsBar\" class=\"iteration-pills-bar\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step Heading -->\n        <div class=\"teach-header-row\">\n          <h1 id=\"teachStepTitle\" class=\"teach-step-title\">Step 1: Create the variable</h1>\n          <span id=\"teachScopeBadge\" class=\"scope-pill scope-global\">GLOBAL SCOPE</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Current Code Line Box -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">Code:</div>\n          <div id=\"teachCodeBox\" class=\"teach-code-box\">c = 0</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- TASK 2.1, 2.2, 2.3: THONNY-STYLE STEP-BY-STEP SUB-EXPRESSION EVALUATOR -->\n        <div id=\"thonnyExprBox\" class=\"thonny-expr-card\">\n          <div class=\"thonny-expr-header\">\n            <span class=\"thonny-badge\">Thonny Expression Evaluator</span>\n            <span id=\"thonnySubStepCounter\" class=\"thonny-subcounter\">Evaluation 1 of 1</span>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"thonnyLiveCode\" class=\"thonny-live-code\"></div>\n          <div id=\"thonnyFocusNote\" class=\"thonny-focus-note\"></div>\n          <div id=\"thonnyTrailChips\" class=\"thonny-trail-chips\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step Calculation Breakdown (Shown on arithmetic / condition / loop steps) -->\n        <div id=\"teachCalculationBox\" class=\"teach-calc-box hidden\">\n          <div id=\"calcCurrentNumRow\" class=\"calc-row hidden\">\n            <span class=\"calc-label\">Current number:</span>\n            <code id=\"calcCurrentNumVal\" class=\"calc-val\"></code>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc-row\">\n            <span class=\"calc-label\">Before:</span>\n            <code id=\"calcBeforeVal\" class=\"calc-val\"></code>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc-row\">\n            <span class=\"calc-label\">Calculation:</span>\n            <code id=\"calcFormulaVal\" class=\"calc-val calc-highlight\"></code>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"calc-row\">\n            <span class=\"calc-label\">After:</span>\n            <code id=\"calcAfterVal\" class=\"calc-val calc-after\"></code>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- What does this mean? -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">What does this mean?</div>\n          <p id=\"teachMeaningText\" class=\"teach-meaning-text\"></p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Variable values now -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">Variable values now:</div>\n          <div id=\"teachVarsNowBox\" class=\"teach-vars-now\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- What happens next? -->\n        <div class=\"teach-section teach-next-box\">\n          <div class=\"teach-label\">What happens next?</div>\n          <p id=\"teachNextText\" class=\"teach-next-text\"></p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Final Answer Celebration Banner (Shown on final return or final print step) -->\n        <div id=\"finalAnswerBanner\" class=\"final-answer-banner hidden\">\n          <div id=\"finalAnswerHeading\" class=\"final-answer-heading\">Final answer: 6</div>\n          <div id=\"finalAnswerDetail\" class=\"final-answer-detail\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- AREA 3: SCOPE ISOLATION & STACK/HEAP MEMORY VISUALIZER (RIGHT) -->\n    <section class=\"area-card area-variables\" aria-label=\"Scopes and Memory Reference Model\">\n      <div class=\"area-header-row\">\n        <h2 class=\"area-heading\">Scopes & Memory Model</h2>\n        <span class=\"ref-legend-pill\" title=\"Python variables store memory addresses pointing to Heap objects\">Name → @Addr → Value</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- TASK 4.1 & 4.2: ISOLATED STACK SCOPES (GLOBAL vs. LOCAL) -->\n      <div class=\"memory-section-block\">\n        <div class=\"memory-section-title\">1. Stack Frames (Global vs. Local Scope Isolation)</div>\n        <div id=\"scopeFramesContainer\" class=\"scope-frames-container\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- TASK 3.1, 3.2 & 3.3: HEAP MEMORY OBJECTS + VISUAL GARBAGE COLLECTION -->\n      <div class=\"memory-section-block\">\n        <div class=\"heap-header-row\">\n          <span class=\"memory-section-title\">2. Heap Memory (@Address → Object Value)</span>\n          <button id=\"btnToggleGC\" class=\"btn-gc-toggle\" title=\"Toggle unreferenced / garbage-collected objects from earlier loop steps\">\n            Show GC'd (0)\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"heapObjectsContainer\" class=\"heap-objects-container\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Clean Visual List Box for `nums` / `arr` / `s.items` -->\n      <div id=\"visualListsContainer\" class=\"visual-list-wrap\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Live Console Output (`print`) when program prints values -->\n      <div id=\"stdoutSection\" class=\"memory-section-block hidden\">\n        <div class=\"memory-section-title\">3. Console Output (print)</div>\n        <pre id=\"stdoutBox\" class=\"stdout-box\"></pre>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- =========================================================\n       AREA 4: COMPLETE CODE ITERATION & ALL-STEPS DRY-RUN EXPLORER\n       Visible by default so the whole code execution is clear at a glance\n       ========================================================= -->\n  <section id=\"allIterationsSection\" class=\"iterations-explorer-section\" aria-label=\"All Iterations and Steps Dry-Run\">\n    <div class=\"iterations-explorer-header\">\n      <div class=\"iterations-title-group\">\n        <h2 class=\"iterations-main-title\">📋 Complete Code Iteration & Step-by-Step Dry-Run</h2>\n        <span id=\"iterationsSummaryBadge\" class=\"iterations-summary-badge\">All Steps Visible</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"iterations-controls-group\">\n        <div class=\"view-mode-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n          <button id=\"tabViewGrouped\" type=\"button\" class=\"view-tab-btn active\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n            🔄 Grouped by Iterations / Calls\n          </button>\n          <button id=\"tabViewTable\" type=\"button\" class=\"view-tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n            📊 All Steps Table (1 → N)\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        <button id=\"btnExpandAllIter\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Expand / Collapse All</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"iterations-helper-note\">\n      Every iteration, function call, and line execution from start to finish is listed below. <strong>Click any step or iteration card</strong> to jump the visualizer to that exact moment.\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- View 1: Grouped by Loop Iterations / Method Calls -->\n    <div id=\"iterationsGroupedContainer\" class=\"iterations-grouped-container\"></div>\n\n    <!-- View 2: Full Dry-Run Table (Every Step 1 -> N) -->\n    <div id=\"iterationsTableContainer\" class=\"iterations-table-container hidden\">\n      <div class=\"dryrun-table-scroll\">\n        <table class=\"dryrun-table\" aria-label=\"Complete Execution Dry-Run Table\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Step</th>\n              <th>Line</th>\n              <th>Iteration / Phase</th>\n              <th>Scope</th>\n              <th>Code Executed</th>\n              <th>What Happened / Calculation</th>\n              <th>Variables Snapshot</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody id=\"dryrunTableBody\"></tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- =========================================================\n       OPTIONAL ADVANCED VIEW DRAWER (Hidden by Default)\n       ========================================================= -->\n  <section id=\"advancedViewPanel\" class=\"advanced-drawer hidden\" aria-label=\"Advanced Debugging View\">\n    <div class=\"advanced-header\">\n      <strong>Advanced Debugging Details</strong>\n      <span id=\"advMetadataLabel\" class=\"adv-meta\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"advanced-grid\">\n      <div class=\"adv-box\">\n        <div class=\"adv-title\">Technical Explanation</div>\n        <div id=\"advTechnicalText\" class=\"adv-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adv-box\">\n        <div class=\"adv-title\">Python Symbols on This Line</div>\n        <div id=\"advSymbolsText\" class=\"adv-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adv-box\">\n        <div class=\"adv-title\">Variables Before → After (With Addresses & Types)</div>\n        <div id=\"advFullVarsText\" class=\"adv-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adv-box\">\n        <div class=\"adv-title\">Execution Flowchart</div>\n        <div id=\"flowchartSvgWrap\" class=\"adv-flowchart\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <script src=\"engine.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"explainer.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Add Iteration Jump Strip and Complete Code Iteration & All-Steps Dry-Run Explorer to app_build/index.html","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\app_build\\index.html","toolAction":"Adding Iteration & All-Steps Explorer to app_build/index.html","toolSummary":"Add Iteration & All-Steps Explorer to index.html"}}]}
